  (list_skills, get_skill, list_mcp_servers, mcp_server_status) over
  the existing eo/skill_library.py and eo/mcp_registry.py functions.
  No behavior change - single shared surface for later patches (B1-B4)
  and for eo agents (wired in B5a) to call in-process.
