  from eo/capabilities.py instead of the underlying modules directly.
- New DEFERRED.md at repo root, seeded from architecture plan §3.6.
- New backend/tests/unit/test_eo_capabilities.py pinning the
  pass-through contract.

Ref: MiniMe-CLI-Internal-Architecture-Plan.md §3.1, §3.6
